  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JPL joins RU&#x2019;s Landsm&#xF8;de</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Radikal Ungdom (RU) applies for funding to invite 2-3 members from Juventud del Partido Libertario (JPL) to RU&#x2019;s Annual Meeting (Landsm&#xF8;de), August 11-13th, 2023. The funding will be employed by delegate members of the RU Argentinan Group to then cover the expenses for 2 JPL members&#x2019; travels to Denmark. In short, this activity aims to (i) build a stronger connection between RU and JPL, and (ii) show how RU hosts an annual gathering. Thus, alongside keeping our partnership active, the motivation is to support JPL in regard to further developing organisational structures.</narrative>
  </description>
